# __NAME__

Rust library on the stable toolchain. `[lib]` in `Cargo.toml` points at `src/lib.rs`, which re-exports `funcs` and `types` so consumers name one path.

## Commands

- Build: `cargo build --release`
- Test: `cargo test`
- Test: `cargo test`
- Typecheck: `cargo check` (typechecker `__TYPECHECKER__`)
- Lint: `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` (linter `__LINTER__`)
- Format: `cargo fmt` (formatter `__FORMATTER__`)

`rustfmt.toml` pins hard tabs, tab width 4 and max width 100.
